This project contains a Rust port of the Codex Security TypeScript SDK and CLI.

The original work is:

    codex-security
    Copyright 2026 OpenAI
    https://github.com/openai/codex-security
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The Rust port reimplements the behavior of the `@openai/codex-security`
TypeScript package. Behavioral test cases in this repository are derived from
the upstream `sdk/typescript/tests-ts` suite.

In addition to reimplemented code, this repository redistributes the Codex
Security plugin verbatim, unmodified, under `crates/puncode-security/plugin/`.
That directory is the upstream `_bundled_plugin` tree (version 0.1.14): its
skills, schemas, scripts, references, and assets are OpenAI's work, not this
port's, and are covered by the same Apache License, Version 2.0. It is embedded
in the built binary and unpacked at runtime so a scan needs no separate
install.

This port is not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI.
